## Key Hyperparameters to Add to [nn_params.yaml](file:///home/ebrahim/Ebrahim_Master_Thesis_repo/On-Track-SysID/params/nn_params.yaml)

```yaml
# Existing params
data_collection_duration: 30
num_of_iterations: 6
num_of_epochs: 100
lr: 0.0005
weight_decay: 0.0

# New GRU params
model_type: "GRU"            # "SimpleNN" or "GRU"
sequence_length: 15           # sliding window size (timesteps)
gru_hidden_size: 16           # GRU hidden dimension
gru_num_layers: 1             # number of stacked GRU layers
gru_dropout: 0.0              # dropout between GRU layers (only if num_layers > 1)
use_physics_features: false   # Idea 2: augment input with slip angles & forces
```

---

## Risks and Mitigations

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|-----------|
| Overfitting on 30s of data | Keep GRU small (hidden=16), use weight decay, early stopping |
| Slower training | Single GRU layer + small hidden size keeps training under 10s |
| Sequence edge effects | Discard first W samples from loss computation |
| Hidden state divergence in simulation | Clip hidden state values, reset on NaN detection |
| Breaking existing pipeline | Make `model_type` configurable — keep SimpleNN as fallback |

